  <p id="c-nanshi-011-zangqiyuan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">武敬臧皇后諱<persName id="c-nanshi-011-zangqiyuan:p001:m0006" ref="5cm_eyx_pno">愛親</persName>，東莞人也。祖<persName id="c-nanshi-011-zangqiyuan:p001:m0015" ref="0zd_9uz_t7m">汪</persName>，尚書郎，父<persName id="c-nanshi-011-zangqiyuan:p001:m0022" ref="0zd_9uz_t7m_A">雋</persName>，郡功曹。</p>
